{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近なにかとテンションの高い和田です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前もコメント数100という素晴らしく嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャッチフレーズの件！\nほんとーにありがとー♪あの中から\nみなさまのを参考に考えていきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがまあやのために考えてくれたと思うと嬉しくて嬉しくて、\nニヤニヤもとまりません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テンション高山りっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかとかずみんの雑種"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑種といえば......犬"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私！\n日曜日にタイニープードルという\nティーカッププードルのひとまわりおおきいタイニープードルを買いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ、小さくてかわいいですよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいーでしょー！\n名前は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポテト"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤンチャな 男の子なんだよー\n犬大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダックスフンドを二匹\nチョコちゃんとチェリーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラブラドールを一匹\nチャチャ君"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤドカリを二匹\nヤド君とかり君"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウサギを八匹\n幼稚園の時に、一匹"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(悪いものを食べて死んだと四才位のとき嘘をつかれ、最近、幼稚園にあげたということを聞いた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")\nその事実は、お父さんが間違えて、ポロリと言ってしまい嘘がばれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばぁちゃんはウサギアレルギーだったかららしい.........。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"事実を知り、大泣きをしたら、一匹ウサギを買ってくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、面倒を見るのが大変だったけど、まあやも大きくなったから、ウサギの面倒をみれると思ったから買ってくれたんだと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、新たにもう一匹買い、\nウサギ二匹\nこどもが四匹うまれ、\n七匹になり、いままで、ウサギは八匹かった！\n意味わかるかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハムスター二五匹以上\n子供がたくさん生まれ、気持ち悪いほど増えた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱりかわいいものだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カブトムシ 数えきれないほど、\n今は触れないが、数々の種類を集めていた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金魚は色んな種類\nドジョウやウナギ、カニ、ランチュウ、色々いた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、夏祭りで金魚すくい！増えていきましたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまだに増え続け中"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤバイほど動物や生き物を飼いました！\nでもどれもかわいいものだらけですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は、タイニープードルのポテトのグッツをネットでひたすら見てる毎日です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、この前お母さんが金曜から日曜までまあやんちに来ててました。\nディズニーランドにも行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミッキーのオメメが大きすぎて泣くことはなかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長した"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ沢山の人が居ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなのりものに乗ったり、パレードみたり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人で 充実したあっという間の三日間を過ごしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢の国はサイコーよーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂浪漫"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知するの忘れてたけど、みてくださったかたがいて嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見れなかった方は次！\n是非みてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑浪漫の時の写真ですよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きな公園で撮影だったので、思いっきり遊びました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だーい好きなちっちゃい子もいたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんちゃんもいたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思う存分たくさん遊んだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっぴり寒かったがすぐに熱くなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初のシーンで自転車こいだんだけど、地面ガタガタで、顎がガタガタなって、歯がガチガチなった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガタガタすぎて、まっすぐ進まなくて、木に突撃したりして大変やった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の勉強できて、楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ反省点もたくさんあったので、次に向けて、改善して、素敵な作品を作り出していけたらな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問ターイムッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物とかなんかかってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※ゴキブリさん飼ってるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか、ネズミ飼ってるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勘違いしてるからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飼ってるんじゃなくて住み着いてますからね！\n是非おうちをきれいにして、バイバイしましよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/27/9573747/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}